title: auto-gen alias path (used by ember-quill registration, client_type None) hands out bare two-word pool names with no entropy suffix — collision-prone (16k combos, shared pool with human-assigned names like lyra-quill/storm-ember). All default alias generation should use <client>-<word>-<word>-<4char> like the codex hook path. Audit every gen path via c2c_alias_words.ml consumers.
